1. B2 system: clarify whether insulation of mains from -2.100 to the bottom of the slab is required;
2. K1-1 system: the number of gangways is incorrectly specified in the specification (according to the scheme - 3, in the specification - 2), the number of gangways is incorrectly specified (according to the scheme - 9, in the specification - 10);
