After reviewing the design documentation, the following errors were identified:
1. in the GLE-(G0-D1810BX0)-TE-SKST-001:
1.1. Sheet 15. specify socket type of -USN-RJ-021..024(36);
1.2 Sheet 18: Specify the number of 200x100 tee trays. On the layout - 6pcs, in the specification - 10pcs;
1.3 Sheet 18: The list of materials shows a floor hatch 420x210x82mm, in the specification GLE-(G0-D1810BX0)-TE-SKST-SF-001, the material is 
missing;
1.4 Sheet 18: Note item 5 shows hardware for cabinet fixing, material not included in GLE-(G0-D1810BX0)-TE-SKST-SF-001.
1.5 Sheet 19: Specify the number of openings 400x200mm, 250x200mm. On the layout 400x200mm - 4pcs, 250x200mm - 13pcs;
1.6. Sheet 19: Specify the number of corrugated Dn32 PLL pipe. In the cable list - 1048m;
1.7. Sheet 19: The list of materials includes materials that are not in the bill of materials GLE-(G0-D1810BX0)-TE-SKST-SF-001;
2. In the GLE-(G0-D1810BX0)-TE-SKST-SF-001:
2.1 Sheet 2. Specify the number of RJ45 sockets with 2 ports, on the plan 7pc + 1pc(spare parts) - 8pc, in the bill of materials 9pc;
2.2 Sheet 13: Clarify the quantity of HDPE pipe 32mm and PLL pipe 32mm. According to the cable list HDPE 32mm pipe - 1654m, PLL 32mm pipe 
- 1048m;
2.3 Sheet 16: Specify the number of 200x100 tee trays. On the layout - 13pcs, in the specification - 17pcs;
2.4. Sheets 16-17. Materials 4.18 and 4.19, duplicate 4.1 and 4.2;
2.5. Sheet 17: Specify the number of horizontal 90 degree elbows. 100x100mm.
For details see. Appendices 1...2

