4. The panel G0-ESNUC-D48-102 has been added to the plan (G0-D4810BX0). All outgoing cable lines for the panel G0-ESNUC-D48-102 are taken into account in GLE-(G0-A10300X0)-EL-ESBZ-LC-002 - (TQS-GPP-RHI-GSP-EL-03052_R01);
5. A solution for fastening hangers in rooms 23a and 25 (TQS-GPP-RHI-GSP-EL-03245_R00) has been provided.
6. In the GLE-(G0-D4810BX0)-EL-EMSV-ZA-001 set, references to the title of the RKD of the manufacturer of fastening units for engineering systems 170323-(G0-Z00000X0)-ST-ZA-001 have been added to the list of referenced and attached documents.
7. Sheets № 6, 7, 8, 9, and 10 have been replaced, where the UPS cabinets have been shifted toward the E axis, the middle rack in room 4 has been moved, and a wall mounting point for the rack has been added. According to the GLE-(G0-D4810BX0)-EL-ESPS-ZA-001 title, sheet #6 has been replaced, with an updated tray route layout and equipment arrangement in rooms №4, №6, and №27. Sheet №16, "Drilling Plan," has also been added (TQS-GPP-GSP-RCA-EL-01350_R00).
