from the floor;
- to coordinate the installation of SCS cables in the ceiling space in the cable channel around the perimeter of rooms 13, 14, 15, 22;
- To harmonise the ELOV solutions with the design solutions for rooms 13,10,1, 21,19, 57,18,16, 42,37, 56, 36, provide the installation of junction boxes in these rooms to connect the design lighting system to them. Provide for 3*2.5mm cable;
- to modify the Bill of materials in terms of additional materials;
